auth {
  mode: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{token}}
}

docs {
  # D-Pilot API

  Every request under this collection inherits Bearer auth from the `{{token}}`
  variable. Run **Auth / Login** first — its post-response script stores the JWT
  into `token` automatically. Public endpoints (Health, Public Config, Login)
  override auth to `none`.

  Select an environment (LOCAL by default) to set `{{baseUrl}}` and the id
  placeholders. See CLAUDE.md in this folder for the file-naming system and how
  to keep this collection in sync with the API.
}
